        "node_id": "n_5_548378",
        "thought_text": "Analyze the constraints more closely. Since the maximum value of a_i is 1,000,000,000, the number of operations is bounded. Explore if there's a more efficient way to calculate the maximum operations without simulating each step explicitly.",
