        "thought_text": "Analyze the constraints more closely. Given that the numbers can be up to 1 billion, the current approach might be hitting limits due to the large range of possible values. Consider preprocessing the numbers to reduce their range by dividing out all factors of 2 and 3 before applying the operations. This could simplify the problem and make it feasible to explore all possible sequences of operations within a reasonable time frame.",
